subject: fix(error-handling): replace silent catch {} blocks with logging or intent comments (GAP-P2-ERR)

19 server-side files patched:
- API routes: chat, oauth, providers, ping, tunnel-install
- Auth: dashboardSession — log unexpected JWT errors, keep expected ones silent
- DB adapters: nodeSqlite, bunSqlite, betterSqlite, sqljs — checkpoint + rollback errors logged
- DB repos: usageRepo — connection/apiKey errors logged with context
- DB backup: cleanup catches commented as intentional
- DB migrate: index creation commented as idempotent, marker write failure logged
- machineId: warn on fallback to random UUID, warn on persist failure
- OAuth: kilocode org fetch logged on failure, qoder parse commented as intentional
- MITM: onResponse callback error logged, client.close catches commented as cleanup
- Tailscale: tmp cleanup commented as intentional

Anti-false-positive test added: tests/unit/silent-catch-coverage.test.js
- Scans all 19 target files for bare catch {} without logging or comment
- Proven: test fails when catch {} is reintroduced (anti-false-positive verified)

Co-authored-by: hermes-agent
Signed-off: hermes-agent


